# What goes in the sdist beyond the `clops` package itself.
#
# The sdist ships the test suite, and two tests lint/show `examples.my_company`
# — so the example library has to come along or `pytest` on an unpacked sdist
# fails. `examples` is deliberately NOT an installed package (see
# pyproject.toml); grafting it here puts it in the sdist only, never the wheel.

# setuptools' legacy sdist default only auto-globs `test*.py`, which silently
# dropped `tests/conftest.py` and `tests/__init__.py` — so the sdist shipped a
# test suite that could not pass (40 failures from an uncleared registry).
# Graft the directory so what ships is what runs.
graft tests

graft examples
graft docs
include QUICKSTART.md
include authoring-spec.md
include server.json

# Never ship build/scratch artifacts.
global-exclude *.py[cod]
global-exclude .DS_Store
prune **/__pycache__
prune .claude
prune .github
prune landing-page
prune smoke-tests
prune spikes
prune code_review
